WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.240
Hello, champ! Welcome!

2
00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:17.530
Something new: the AI track!

3
00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:28.650
What Is AI? · Chapter 1 · Magic or Math?

4
00:00:28.650 --> 00:00:39.920
Magic? Or maths? Let's find out!

5
00:00:39.920 --> 00:00:48.810
Meet Kabir, a big cricket fan

6
00:00:48.810 --> 00:00:58.410
The app shows more cricket cartoons!

7
00:00:58.410 --> 00:01:10.510
How did it know? Is it magic?

8
00:01:10.510 --> 00:01:20.500
Not magic! Let's find out how.

9
00:01:20.500 --> 00:01:26.630
AI = Artificial Intelligence

10
00:01:26.630 --> 00:01:36.640
Artificial: made by people · Intelligence: clever

11
00:01:36.640 --> 00:01:46.040
AI learns patterns from examples, then guesses

12
00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:58.400
Meet Pixi, our cartoon AI helper

13
00:01:58.400 --> 00:02:11.360
AI is not alive. It's a program made with maths.

14
00:02:11.360 --> 00:02:18.450
Pattern: something that repeats or looks alike

15
00:02:18.450 --> 00:02:31.660
Red, yellow, blue, red, yellow… what's next?

16
00:02:31.660 --> 00:02:40.240
Blue! You spotted the pattern!

17
00:02:40.240 --> 00:02:50.920
Cats: whiskers · fur · pointy ears

18
00:02:50.920 --> 00:02:58.070
AI is shown thousands of cat photos

19
00:02:58.070 --> 00:03:11.940
It notices the pattern: whiskers, fur, ears

20
00:03:11.940 --> 00:03:19.300
New photo? "This looks like a cat!"

21
00:03:19.300 --> 00:03:27.500
Examples + a pattern + maths = a guess

22
00:03:27.500 --> 00:03:38.140
Calculator: 7 + 2 = ?

23
00:03:38.140 --> 00:03:54.370
7 + 2 is always 9. A fixed rule.

24
00:03:54.370 --> 00:04:02.800
AI guesses from what it has seen

25
00:04:02.800 --> 00:04:11.060
Calculator: fixed rule · AI: a guess

26
00:04:11.060 --> 00:04:20.380
The AI says "Cat!" Hmm… look closely

27
00:04:20.380 --> 00:04:31.060
Oops! It's a fox, not a cat

28
00:04:31.060 --> 00:04:43.650
AI can be wrong. A calculator doesn't guess.

29
00:04:43.650 --> 00:04:59.700
The app found a pattern in what Kabir watched

30
00:04:59.700 --> 00:05:09.280
Voice assistants guess words from many voices

31
00:05:09.280 --> 00:05:18.730
Riya: "AI works by magic!" What do you say?

32
00:05:18.730 --> 00:05:27.200
No! AI uses maths to find patterns.

33
00:05:27.200 --> 00:05:46.390
Which one is most like AI?

34
00:05:46.390 --> 00:05:58.570
The video suggestion! It guesses from patterns.

35
00:05:58.570 --> 00:06:02.520
Your turn: practice check

36
00:06:02.520 --> 00:06:14.960
Why is suggesting a cartoon more like AI?

37
00:06:14.960 --> 00:06:31.370
7 + 2: a fixed rule. A cartoon: a guess.

38
00:06:31.370 --> 00:06:36.420
AI is maths, not magic

39
00:06:36.420 --> 00:06:40.940
AI finds patterns in lots of examples

40
00:06:40.940 --> 00:06:45.740
Calculator: fixed rule. AI: a guess.

41
00:06:45.740 --> 00:06:49.100
AI is not alive, and it can be wrong

42
00:06:49.100 --> 00:06:57.310
Chapter 1 done!

43
00:06:57.310 --> 00:07:04.110
Next: Quiz · Tap Finish
